              "content": "六大维度",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "，每个维度下再细分具体的文件类型。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "维度一：产品与服务详情 (Product & Service Details)",
